{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215110","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621511001:1":{"text":"魔法書はどうした？『乳幼児からの魔法入門』とかいうやつだ。もう手に入れたのか？","source_cn":"魔法书呢？那本叫《婴幼儿魔法启蒙》的，你们弄回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3631904E3141A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621511002:1":{"text":"えっと、そ、その……確かにニャーリスのところから盗み出したんだけど……と、途中で人間の生徒に遭遇して……","source_cn":"呃，从、从从……喵丽丝那边确实偷到了，但、但回来的路上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D6442EF765D4519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621511003:1":{"text":"何か疑われてもダメだから、その場に本を置いていくしかなくて……もう図書館に返されたと思う……","source_cn":"我们怕暴露，只能丢下书……他们好像把它带回了图书馆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7908CB4872A3DCAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621511004:1":{"text":"なんだと！？あれはとんでもなく邪悪な本なんだぞ！","source_cn":"什么！？那可是一本极其邪恶的魔法书！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F4EDD6726BB66F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621511005:1":{"text":"もし再びニャーリスの魔の手に渡れば、レヒラム全土が猫の爪とぎ板になってしまうぞ！","source_cn":"如果落到喵丽丝那个魔王的手里，整个莱希拉姆都得变成猫抓板！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18A778D7A5F2DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621511006:1":{"text":"こ、これから……ど、どうするの？","source_cn":"现在……怎么办呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF33743378D2E6E04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621511007:1":{"text":"あの魔王は今ごろ本がなくなったことに気付いて、警戒を強めているはずだ。","source_cn":"喵丽丝肯定已经察觉书丢了，现在一定提高警惕了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DE2EB22D92ABF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621511008:1":{"text":"我々が本を始末できなくなった以上、彼女が目的を果たす前に、真っ向勝負を挑むしかない！","source_cn":"既然我们没法销毁那本书，就只能赶在她得逞之前，正面对决...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53944DDBF49B844A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621511009:1":{"text":"な、なんだって！？わ……ワンダル、気が狂ったの！？ほ、本気でニャーリスに正面からぶつかるつもり？","source_cn":"什、什么！？你疯……疯了吧汪达尔！你要跟喵丽丝硬碰硬？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1DFC6618B1873A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621511010:1":{"text":"彼女は猫ヒゲ一本で魔法を操り、スズメの群れを毛玉みたいにまとめて吹き飛ばすんだって！","source_cn":"听说她只用一根猫胡须就能施法，把整群麻雀卷成个毛球飞走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D90C187CA97DF40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621511011:1":{"text":"じ、実際に彼女の魔法を見た者はいないけど……み、みんなが口を揃えて、あれはヤバいと言ってるよ……ほ、本当に行くの？","source_cn":"谁也没真见过她出手，但大家都说她的风魔法超可怕……你、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AA1A33768B4E471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621511012:1":{"text":"だったら一匹で行けよ！僕は猫の奴隷になんかなりたくないからな！","source_cn":"你一个人去吧！我可不想变成猫奴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD25ABBB34DBEDA5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621511013:1":{"text":"そうだ、あ、あの……まだご飯を食べてないから……ぼ、僕はこのへんで……","source_cn":"阿就、就……我还有饭没吃完，我先走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFF288DF8B1B37CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621511014:1":{"text":"数匹の犬は一斉に散り散りになり、たちまち姿を消してしまった。ただワンダルだけはその場に残り、揺るぎない眼差しで何かを見据え、尾を高く掲げていた。","source_cn":"几只狗狗一哄而散，转眼就跑得不见踪影。只剩下汪达尔站在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1F85EDA0EB12A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621511015:1":{"text":"トロ、プリ……おまえたちまで怖気づくのか！","source_cn":"……憨憨，屁屁！连你们也怕了吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCF7A3A2C7806C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume